      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "MonoRepo\n\nparking \n\nbackend\nsrc/main/java->. backend co\nresource -> application.yml (api context )\nbuilt -> maven\n serc/main/webapp/webinf-> fotnend build ()\n\nforntned\n   src/ -> react package.json\n    build tool -> webpack/ gurnt \n    putput folder-> build ()-> index.html, -> minified js file , fonts etc -> app.cyx.js\n    copy eveything intp index.js-> react container  \no \n\n using maven -> war \n\n\n\nlocalhost:8080/ - > index.html -> client\nlocalhost:8080/api/getspot()- > backend \n\nlocalhost:8080/invoice/view->   api -> fetch html (/invoice/generate )-> html - return \n\ndeplyoment scriptor -> webinf folder -> \n\n\nwebconfigsercurty [adapter-> \nallow(**/font/*)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "MonoRepo\n\nparking \n\nbackend\nsrc/main/java->. backend co\nresource -> application.yml (api context )\nbuilt -> maven\n serc/main/webapp/webinf-> fotnend build ()\n\nforntned\n   src/ -> react package.json\n    build tool -> webpack/ gurnt \n    putput folder-> build ()-> index.html, -> minified js file , fonts etc -> app.cyx.js\n    copy eveything intp index.js-> react container  \no \n\n using maven -> war \n\n\n\nlocalhost:8080/ - > index.html -> client\nlocalhost:8080/api/getspot()- > backend \n\nlocalhost:8080/invoice/view->   api -> fetch html (/invoice/generate )-> html - return \n\ndeplyoment scriptor -> webinf folder -> \n\n\nwebconfigsercurty [adapter-> \nallow(**/font/*)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
